//! The 144-entry env-object table of the original (`CEnvObjectManager`, 0x20 bytes per entry, ghidra 0xD7AA88).
//! Extracted from libABK291.so with an ELF reader (helper name -> model / anim / smackable type / flags).
//! Word meaning (from `GetSmackableTypeFromEnvObjectType @001e1db0`, `GetEnvObjectTypeFromHelperName @001e1dec`,
//! `LoadEnvObject @001e29b8`): +0 name, +4 model path, +8 anim path, +0xC smackable type (0x7e = none), the rest are flag words
//! (`w4`..`w7`) whose individual meaning is not decoded (UNRESOLVED: names of w4..w7).
//! Model paths use the asset-path prefixes `ENVOBJ:` (pak/envobjects) and `MODELTHEME:` (the track theme's models.pak).

#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy)]
